    {
      "title": "Lubufu",
      "text": "Go to the lake south of Tai Bwo Wannai and fish 23 raw karambwanji (just north of fairy ring code CKR).",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "North of the Karamja lodestone, talk to Lubufu.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "I wasn't going anywhere..."
        }
      ],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Talk to him again.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Talk about him..."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "What do you do?"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "What do you use for bait?"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Talk about him..."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "What do you do?"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "I could help collect the bait."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "You sound like you could do with the help."
        }
      ],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Talk to Lubufu to give him 20 raw karambwanji.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Talk to Lubufu 3 more times as follows<ul><li>Talk to him again.</li><li>Talk again.</li><li>Talk a third time.</li></ul>",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "What do you do with your Karambwan?"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "What do you use to catch Karambwan?"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "What does Karambwan taste like?"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Yes!"
        }
      ],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Drop the karambwan vessel and talk to him to get a second vessel, then pick up the first.<ul><li>Optional: Use 1 raw karambwanji on a karambwan vessel, then fish at the spot next to Lubufu (requires 65 ) to complete a Medium Karamja achievement.</li></ul>",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Actually, I've lost my Karambwan vessel."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "[Any option]"
        }
      ],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Use another karambwanji on a vessel and keep it for the next step.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "title": "Tiadeche",
      "text": "Head to the north-east coast of Karamja, across the river and talk to Tiadeche (fairy ring code DKP).",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Is there anything I can do to help?"
        }
      ],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Use the loaded vessel on him.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Yes"
        }
      ],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Head south, kill a jogre and take its bones.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Go to Musa Point and buy one Karamjan rum from the pub. You can also buy rum from the Dead Man's Chest in Brimhaven. The rum will break if you teleport with it in your inventory. It will be stolen by a monkey if you ride the cart to Shilo Village with it in your inventory.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Pick a banana or buy one from the traders at the Brimhaven dock, cut it for slices.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Use a banana slice on the Karamjan rum - you can now teleport without having the rum disappear from your inventory.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "title": "Tamayu and the Shaikahan",
      "text": "Take some seaweed near the shore of Cairn Isle (fairy ring code CKR).",
